    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「きっちり時間どおりに待ちあわせ場所にきたし、なかなか見どころあるやんか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「この調子なら、正式にウチの子分にしたってもえぇねんで〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ちゃんと、やることやったら褒めたるからなぁ？　ウチは優しい親分やで〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ん？　『やること』ってのは、当然……悪いことやで！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ウチは君咲学院きっての大悪党、地獄の底から這いあがってきた悪魔！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「柊るな様やからなぁ〜！　うひゃひゃひゃ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「って、おおきな声だすんちゃうわアホ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
